"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc=self.webpackChunkwp_woocommerce_pre_order_doc||[]).push([[897],{7725(e,t,a){a.r(t),a.d(t,{_pageData:()=>s,default:()=>n});var r=a(641);const s=JSON.parse('{"path":"/woocommerce-pre-order/overview.html","title":"Technical Overview & Requirements","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"woocommerce-pre-order/overview.md"}'),o={name:"overview.md"},n=(0,a(6262).A)(o,[["render",function(e,t,a,s,o,n){return(0,r.uX)(),(0,r.CE)("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,r.Fv)('<h1 id="technical-overview-requirements" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#technical-overview-requirements"><span>Technical Overview &amp; Requirements</span></a></h1><p>Before installing and setting up <strong>WooCommerce Pre-Order</strong>, verify that your server environment meets the minimum standards to ensure optimal database transactions, scheduled cron actions, and payment processing.</p><hr><h2 id="system-requirements" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#system-requirements"><span>System Requirements</span></a></h2><p>To ensure stability, security, and high performance (especially during heavy pre-sale launches), the following stack is recommended:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Component</th><th style="text-align:left;">Minimum Requirement</th><th style="text-align:left;">Recommended</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>PHP Version</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>7.4</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>8.0+</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>WordPress Version</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>6.7</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>7.0+</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>WooCommerce Version</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>10.0</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>10.9+</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>MySQL Version</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>5.7</code></td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>8.0</code> or MariaDB <code>10.5</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>SSL Certificate</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Required for payments</td><td style="text-align:left;">TLS 1.3</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>WP-Cron / System Cron</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Enabled</td><td style="text-align:left;">System Cron (every 5-10m)</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="core-capabilities-performance" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#core-capabilities-performance"><span>Core Capabilities &amp; Performance</span></a></h2><p>The plugin is built to be fast, stable, and fully integrated with the WooCommerce storefront:</p><h3 id="_1-high-performance-scalability" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-high-performance-scalability"><span>1. High Performance &amp; Scalability</span></a></h3><p>Unlike standard plugins that slow down your website when managing hundreds of pre-orders, this plugin uses an optimized storage system separate from your primary post database. This prevents website bloat and keeps your shop page loading quickly, even during high-traffic pre-sale campaigns.</p><h3 id="_2-payment-flow-flexibility" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-payment-flow-flexibility"><span>2. Payment Flow Flexibility</span></a></h3><p>Support for three key sales models:</p><ul><li><strong>Full Payment Upfront:</strong> Customers pay 100% of the price at checkout. The order is marked as a pre-order and is fulfilled once the product stock becomes available.</li><li><strong>Partial Payment (Deposit):</strong> Customers pay a small upfront deposit (fixed or percentage) to secure their pre-order, and pay the remaining balance later when the product is released.</li><li><strong>Pay on Arrival:</strong> Customers book their pre-orders without any immediate upfront payment, paying the complete order value only when the item is released and ready to ship.</li></ul><h3 id="_3-automated-task-scheduler" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-automated-task-scheduler"><span>3. Automated Task Scheduler</span></a></h3><p>The system runs background updates to manage active campaign timelines, update countdown timers, send out scheduled stock reminders, and process pre-order balance invoicing automatically.</p><hr><h2 id="compatibility-status" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#compatibility-status"><span>Compatibility Status</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>High-Performance Order Storage (HPOS):</strong> Fully compatible.</li><li><strong>Cart &amp; Checkout Blocks:</strong> Fully compatible. The custom hooks translate pre-order checkout states perfectly onto block-based layouts.</li><li><strong>Multi-Currency Plugins:</strong> Supports base currency conversions for deposits and balance payments.</li><li><strong>Stripe Gateway:</strong> Out-of-the-box integration for auto-charging balances using Stripe card tokens.</li></ul>',19)])])}]])}}]);